Step 2. Validate PRSs and test biomarker associations

Scriptvalidation/HABS-HD_prs_phenotype_validation.qmd

PurposePerforms two analyses:

Phenotype validation: tests whether each PRS predicts its matched phenotype in HABS-HD

Endophenotype analysis: tests whether each PRS is associated with AD-related plasma biomarkers

This script also reads precomputed composite PRS biomarker results for comparison.

Main input shared_data/habshd_master_df.rds

Additional inputcompositePRS/results/rds/endo_results.rds

Outputs

results/rds/habshd_prs_validation_base_dataset.rds

results/rds/habshd_prs_endophenotype_base_dataset.rds

results/rds/habshd_prs_validation_results.rds

results/rds/habshd_prs_endophenotype_results.rds

results/rds/habshd_combined_endophenotype_results_table.rds

results tables, figures, and workbook exports
InterpretationThis is the PRS QC / validation layer. It checks whether the PRSs behave sensibly in the HABS-HD cohort before or alongside downstream scientific association analyses.